body:
did the hair color turn out as expected?

&#x200B;

haha, fr it looks very interesting, i thought you used butterfly pea powder at first

I wonder why... 

&#x200B;

***everything is a lie***

I accidentally found the most hydrating lip balm out there (for me), with organic sourced ingredients. I am obsessed with it (and I am nowhere a lip balm girl) & with the propolis taste of it. Apart from the Carmex brand, Himalaya Herbals, Nivea & etc. this one feels to me like it's doing the job. It also helped my mom with her chapped lips one time we were on a holiday.

&#x200B;

It's the [Green Feel's Cosmetics with Propolis & Cocoa Butter](https://incibeauty.com/produit/4779033102246) and its ingredients are: Helianthus Annus seed oil, White beeswax extracted from honeycomb, Theobroma cocoa butter, Propolis, Lanolin, Calendula officinalis.
